sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Owner as SME Owner
    participant Web as GeM Saathi Web App
    participant Local as Browser Store and Event Queue
    participant API as Session and Funnel API
    participant AppDB as Application Database
    participant Research as Pseudonymous Research Event Store

    Owner->>Web: Open a referral link
    Web->>Local: Read saved session and pending events
    Web->>API: Resolve referral code and session ID
    API->>AppDB: Validate active partner referral code
    AppDB-->>API: Referral source and campaign
    API-->>Web: Session token and attribution

    loop Each meaningful page or tool action
        Owner->>Web: View content, submit input or click CTA
        Web->>Local: Save current answers and progress immediately
        Web->>Local: Queue event with event ID, time and referral context
        Web->>API: Send consent-safe event idempotently
        API->>Research: Insert event unless event ID already exists
        Research-->>API: Accepted or existing receipt
        API-->>Web: Event receipt
        Web->>Local: Remove acknowledged event from queue
    end

    alt Connection becomes unavailable
        Web-->>Owner: Continue with cached content where possible
        Owner->>Web: Complete an available step
        Web->>Local: Persist answers and append ordered events
        Web-->>Owner: Show saved-on-device status

        Note over Web,API: Connection is restored
        Web->>Local: Read oldest unacknowledged event
        loop Until pending queue is empty
            Local->>API: Retry with original event ID and session version
            API->>Research: Deduplicate and store event
            Research-->>API: Authoritative receipt
            API-->>Local: Acknowledge event
        end
        Web-->>Owner: Show synchronized status
    else Session exists on another device
        Owner->>Web: Enter consented phone or email resume link
        Web->>API: Request saved session
        API->>AppDB: Resolve contact token and latest progress
        AppDB-->>API: Session snapshot without research identifiers
        API-->>Web: Saved answers, report and checklist position
        Web->>Local: Cache restored state
        Web-->>Owner: Resume at the last useful next action
    end

    opt Owner withdraws consent or requests deletion
        Owner->>Web: Submit privacy request
        Web->>API: Revoke delivery consent and request scoped deletion
        API->>AppDB: Delete or anonymize contact-linked session data
        API->>Research: Remove linkability while preserving allowed aggregates
        API-->>Web: Confirm completion and retained aggregate scope
        Web->>Local: Clear local contact and session data
    end
